OL,3,GNEWSASex offender caught after three
OL,4,Aweeks on the run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sex offender who escaped from a
OL,7,FLincolnshire prison more than three
OL,8,Fweeks ago has been caught after being
OL,9,Fspotted by police.
OL,11,FJames Hands, 38, from Nottingham, was
OL,12,Freported missing from HMP North Sea
OL,13,FCamp in Boston on 1 September.
OL,15,FHe was arrested on Monday following a
OL,16,Fshort foot chase in Nottingham city
OL,17,Fcentre, Nottinghamshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
