OL,3,GNEWSASex offender caught after three
OL,4,Aweeks on the run
OL,5,
OL,6,FHands has been charged with escaping
OL,7,Ffrom lawful custody and possession of a
OL,8,Fknife blade in a public place. He is
OL,9,Fdue to appear at Nottingham Crown Court
OL,10,Fon 20 October.
